OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and sunny at first for many
OL,6,Finland places. Scattered showers
OL,7,Finitially across Norfolk, and perhaps
OL,8,Fother eastern areas, gradually spread
OL,9,Ffurther inland as cloud increases.
OL,10,FBreezy inland, and rather windy along
OL,11,Fthe coast. Feeling rather cool
OL,12,Feverywhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers mainly die away this
OL,15,Fevening, leaving clear spells, then
OL,16,Freturn later in the night. Initially
OL,17,Fshowers reach eastern areas, but may
OL,18,Fextend further west, perhaps becoming
OL,19,Flocally heavy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
