OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOften cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, these possibly heavy at times
OL,7,Fand also merging into long spells of
OL,8,Frain across eastern areas later.
OL,9,FFeeling cool. Becoming windy along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOften
OL,13,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain
OL,14,FMonday and Tuesday, but also some
OL,15,Fdrier periods. Potentially spells of
OL,16,Fheavy rain for Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,17,Fwill be generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
